---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);

const firstRunHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/first-run/');
const archiveHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/archive/');
const redesignHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/');
const successorExplorationHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/exploration/');
const successorReportHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/report/');
const stage1EvolutionHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage1-evolution/');
const stage2AnalysisHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-7b-analysis/');
const mechanismHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/mechanism-1-0/');
const archiveLinks = [
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage1-previous/'), label: t('历史 Stage 1', 'Historical Stage 1') },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/'), label: t('旧 Stage 2：256-window 设计', 'Old Stage 2: 256-window design') },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/'), label: 'Ceiling-1.0' },
  { href: p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/harness-2-0/'), label: t('Harness 诊断记录', 'Harness diagnostic record') },
];
---
<section class="map-lobby" data-testid="openevo-capability-map-lobby" aria-labelledby="map-lobby-title">
  <header class="map-lobby__head">
    <p>OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · CAPABILITY EXPLORATION</p>
    <h1 id="map-lobby-title">{t('OpenEvo 能力探索', 'OpenEvo capability exploration')}</h1>
    <div class="map-lobby__intro">
      <strong>{t(
        '我们先跑了一轮完整的 Stage 1 → Stage 2。7B 证明这套方法能够持续产生参数更新，3B 和长期运行则暴露了更新规则、行动接口和参数容量的问题。',
        'We first ran a full Stage 1 → Stage 2 exploration. The 7B run showed that the method could sustain parameter updates, while the 3B run and long-horizon execution exposed problems in the update rule, action interface, and parameter capacity.'
      )}</strong>
      <span>{t(
        '后来的 OpenEvo successor 直接来自这些实验，但行动接口的变化会改变模型真正走出的轨迹，所以新版不能假装是旧实验的普通下一步。第二张主地图现在专门讲 Qwen2.5-3B + Qwen3-1.7B，并在里面分成“探索版”和“报告与论文版”两种读法；旧轨迹保留为历史证据，不冒充新版数据。 第三张主地图继续向前一步：不再只问分数，而是用 TaskVector 与 parameter-theme 因果干预测试 OpenEvo 到底学进了什么，并在证据足够时尝试主动指导下一次自我进化。',
        'The later OpenEvo successor came directly from those experiments, but changing the action interface changes the trajectories the model actually produces. The second primary map now focuses on Qwen2.5-3B + Qwen3-1.7B and splits into exploration and report/paper views, while old trajectories remain predecessor evidence. The third primary map moves one level deeper: instead of only asking about scores, it uses TaskVector and parameter-theme causal interventions to test what OpenEvo actually learned and, only with enough evidence, whether that structure can steer later self-improvement.'
      )}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="map-lobby__choices" aria-label={t('选择实验地图', 'Choose an experiment map')}>
    <a class="map-choice map-choice--historical" href={firstRunHref} data-map-choice="first-run">
      <span class="map-choice__state">{t('历史地图', 'HISTORICAL MAP')}</span>
      <h2>{t('第一轮 OpenEvo 实验', 'First OpenEvo experiment run')}</h2>
      <p>{t('从旧 Stage 1 走到 Stage 2，优先看 7B 怎样持续更新、参数容量为什么中途需要 amendment，以及 3B 怎样把研究推向新的 Harness。', 'Follow the old Stage 1 into Stage 2, with the 7B sustained-evolution path first, the capacity amendment in context, and the 3B evidence that pushed the project toward a new harness.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入第一轮实验 →', 'Open the first-run map →')}</strong>
    </a>

    <a class="map-choice map-choice--redesign" href={redesignHref} data-map-choice="redesign">
      <span class="map-choice__state">{t('当前 successor · 3B + 1.7B', 'CURRENT SUCCESSOR · 3B + 1.7B')}</span>
      <h2>{t('3B + 1.7B：重新设计 OpenEvo', '3B + 1.7B: redesigning OpenEvo')}</h2>
      <p>{t('从 202609030400 shared strategy-neutral Harness 开始，两个模型各自完成 canonical Stage 1，再进入 post-hoc MiniMax 与 bounded downstream。进入后可以选“探索版”看真实绕路，也可以选“报告与论文版”直接看最终设计、数字与 claim boundary。', 'Starting from the 202609030400 shared strategy-neutral harness, both models independently complete canonical Stage 1 before post-hoc MiniMax and bounded downstream preparation. Inside, choose the exploration view for the real detours or the report/paper view for the final design, metrics, and claim boundaries.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入 3B + 1.7B successor →', 'Open the 3B + 1.7B successor →')}</strong>
    </a>

    <a class="map-choice map-choice--mechanism" href={mechanismHref} data-map-choice="mechanism-1-0">
      <span class="map-choice__state">{t('新主实验 · 机制与干预', 'NEW PRIMARY PROGRAM · MECHANISM + INTERVENTION')}</span>
      <h2>{t('Mechanism-1.0：从参数变化到主动干预', 'Mechanism-1.0: from parameter change to causal intervention')}</h2>
      <p>{t('沿用 Ceiling 留下的参数轨迹，先冻结 TaskVector 与 principal themes，再做 signed / dose-response / 同范数随机对照；只有因果信号通过预注册门槛，才允许启动 guided OpenEvo microtrial。', 'Reuse the parameter trajectory left by Ceiling: freeze TaskVectors and principal themes, then run signed, dose-response, and norm-matched random controls. A guided OpenEvo microtrial is allowed only after the preregistered causal gate passes.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('进入 Mechanism-1.0 →', 'Open Mechanism-1.0 →')}</strong>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <section class="map-lobby__deep-dives" aria-labelledby="deep-dives-title">
    <header>
      <p>RESEARCH DEEP DIVES</p>
      <h2 id="deep-dives-title">{t('第二张地图有两种读法，7B 参数分析继续单独保留', 'Two views of the successor, with the 7B parameter analysis preserved separately')}</h2>
      <span>{t('探索版和报告版消费同一 successor facts；它们不是两个实验 arm。7B Stage 2 deep dive 仍属于第一轮 historical evidence。', 'Exploration and report consume the same successor facts; they are not two experimental arms. The 7B Stage-2 deep dive remains historical evidence from the first campaign.')}</span>
    </header>
    <nav aria-label={t('专题研究地图', 'Focused research maps')}>
      <a href={successorExplorationHref} data-deep-dive="successor-exploration">
        <small>{t('第二张地图 · 探索版', 'SECOND MAP · EXPLORATION')}</small>
        <strong>{t('真实探索史：假设、证伪、回退与 freeze', 'Real exploration: hypotheses, falsification, backtracking, freeze')}</strong>
        <span>{t('3B 太弱 → 15/30 horizon → sampling / history → self-deliberation → action channel → paired 3B/1.7B → shared Harness → 4096 失败 → bounded 10+10。', 'Weak 3B behavior → 15/30 horizon → sampling/history → self-deliberation → action channel → paired 3B/1.7B → shared harness → 4096 failure → bounded 10+10.')}</span>
        <b>{t('进入探索版 →', 'Open exploration →')}</b>
      </a>
      <a href={successorReportHref} data-deep-dive="successor-report">
        <small>{t('第二张地图 · 报告与论文版', 'SECOND MAP · REPORT / PAPER')}</small>
        <strong>{t('最终设计：What / Why / Evidence / Boundary', 'Final design: What / Why / Evidence / Boundary')}</strong>
        <span>{t('shared strategy-neutral Harness → canonical 1,440×2 → raw bootstrap 结果 → MiniMax post-hoc → bounded carriers → PRE_STAGE2_READY。', 'Shared strategy-neutral harness → canonical 1,440×2 → raw bootstrap results → MiniMax post-hoc → bounded carriers → PRE_STAGE2_READY.')}</span>
        <b>{t('进入报告版 →', 'Open report →')}</b>
      </a>
      <a href={stage2AnalysisHref} data-deep-dive="stage2-7b-analysis">
        <small>{t('第一张地图 · 7B 参数证据', 'FIRST MAP · 7B PARAMETER EVIDENCE')}</small>
        <strong>{t('7B Stage 2 参数实验与分析', '7B Stage-2 parameter experiments and analysis')}</strong>
        <span>{t('从旧门槛走到持续 SD-LoRA 更新、Task Vector diagnostic-only、容量 amendment 与 transfer 边界。', 'Follow the old gate into sustained SD-LoRA learning, diagnostic-only Task Vector geometry, the capacity amendment, and transfer boundaries.')}</span>
        <b>{t('进入 7B 分析 →', 'Open 7B analysis →')}</b>
      </a>
      <a href={stage1EvolutionHref} data-deep-dive="stage1-evolution" class="is-compat">
        <small>{t('兼容旧入口', 'COMPATIBILITY ENTRY')}</small>
        <strong>{t('旧 Stage 1 evolution 链接仍可访问', 'Old Stage-1 evolution link still works')}</strong>
        <span>{t('旧 deep link 现在挂到同一探索版组件，不再维护第二套事实。', 'The legacy deep link now mounts the same exploration component instead of maintaining a second fact set.')}</span>
        <b>{t('打开兼容入口 →', 'Open compatibility entry →')}</b>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <details class="map-lobby__archive">
    <summary>{t('实验档案：旧 Stage 1、旧 Stage 2、Ceiling-1.0 与 Harness 诊断', 'Experiment archive: old Stage 1, old Stage 2, Ceiling-1.0, and harness diagnostics')}</summary>
    <p>{t('这些页面保留精确的历史实验、数字和技术证据，但不再和主地图争夺第一层导航。Server/Kaggle、429/retry、checkpoint / HF、runtime patch 与 PR / SHA 也集中放进完整档案。', 'These pages preserve exact historical experiments, metrics, and technical evidence without competing with the primary maps for top-level navigation. Server/Kaggle, 429/retry, checkpoint / HF, runtime patches, and PR / SHA evidence are grouped in the full archive.')}</p>
    <a class="map-lobby__archive-main" href={archiveHref}>{t('打开完整实验档案 →', 'Open the full experiment archive →')}</a>
    <nav aria-label={t('实验档案链接', 'Experiment archive links')}>{archiveLinks.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}</nav>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
.map-lobby{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto 4rem}.map-lobby__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);gap:1.6rem;align-items:end;padding:1.5rem 0 1.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.map-lobby__head>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .68rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.09em}.map-lobby__head h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5.6vw,5rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.055em}.map-lobby__intro{display:grid;gap:.5rem;max-width:42rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.map-lobby__intro strong{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.02rem}.map-lobby__intro span{font-size:.92rem}.map-lobby__choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;padding:1.4rem 0}.map-choice{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.72rem;min-height:16.5rem;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-feature);background:var(--surface);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .16s ease,background-color .16s ease}.map-choice:hover,.map-choice:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--surface-muted)}.map-choice:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.map-choice__state{width:max-content;font:800 .66rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}.map-choice--redesign .map-choice__state,.map-choice--mechanism .map-choice__state{color:var(--accent-deep)}.map-choice h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.1rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}.map-choice p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.map-choice>strong{align-self:end;margin-top:auto;color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.9rem}.map-lobby__deep-dives{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.55fr) minmax(0,1.45fr);gap:1rem;padding:1.1rem 0 1.35rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.map-lobby__deep-dives header>p{margin:0;color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .58rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.map-lobby__deep-dives header h2{margin:.35rem 0 .45rem;font-size:1.16rem;line-height:1.18}.map-lobby__deep-dives header span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.52}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav>a{display:grid;gap:.33rem;padding:.9rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--surface);color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav>a:hover,.map-lobby__deep-dives nav>a:focus-visible{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--surface-muted)}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav>a.is-compat{border-style:dashed;opacity:.72}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav small{color:var(--accent-deep);font:800 .57rem/1.2 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.06em}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav strong{font-size:.96rem;line-height:1.25}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.52}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav b{margin-top:.1rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.76rem}.map-lobby__archive{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem 0;color:var(--muted)}.map-lobby__archive summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);font-weight:750;line-height:1.45}.map-lobby__archive p{max-width:48rem;margin:.75rem 0;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6}.map-lobby__archive-main{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:.7rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.88rem;font-weight:760;text-underline-offset:.2em}.map-lobby__archive nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1rem}.map-lobby__archive a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:.88rem;text-underline-offset:.2em}@media(max-width:760px){.map-lobby{width:min(100% - 1rem,1120px)}.map-lobby__head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.65rem;padding:1rem 0}.map-lobby__head>p{grid-column:auto}.map-lobby__head h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,12vw,3.6rem)}.map-lobby__intro{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5}.map-lobby__choices{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:1rem 0}.map-choice{min-height:0;padding:1rem}.map-lobby__deep-dives{grid-template-columns:1fr}.map-lobby__deep-dives nav{grid-template-columns:1fr}.map-lobby__archive nav{display:grid;gap:.55rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.map-choice{transition:none}}
</style>
